TITLE Mix DIC and Ca solutions 1:1; heat 20C to 200C in 10 steps; calcite equil
SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.tsv
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp Ca_species_count
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, SYS("Ca")
END
